===Etymology 1===
<div style="float:right;">
{{wp|ja:}}
{{wp|Donburi}}
[[File:Donburi-bachi by jetalone in Ginza, Tokyo.jpg|thumb|250px|{{lang|ja|丼}} (''donburi''): a large '''[[donburi]] [[bowl]]'''.]]
{{wp|ja:[[丼物|丼物 (the food)]]}}
